1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
One change. Check the ripple.
A recorded update shows why review matters as much as generation.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Change the responsible person.
The update replaced Lara Chen with Nora Cole for the practical session.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Change the quantities.
Eight kits became ten, each still CAD 12.50. Room hire changed from zero to CAD 90.

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Catch the overspend.
The spending limit stayed CAD 200. The updated budget exceeded it by CAD 15.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Check the fact. See its source.
The current workspace gives facts Source cards. Missing evidence needs manual review.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Keep the previous draft.
Completed steps have browser checkpoints. A failed replacement must not erase the saved pack.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Know who processed it.
Receipts identify each provider and model. Optional fallback does not bypass content checks.

8
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
AI drafts. You decide.
The Willow Prepare and Update passed their 54 declared checks combined. One case is not an accuracy rate.
